flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Navigate to Patient Profile — Diet Plans tab]
    B --> C{Authorized?\nAdmin or Doktor}
    C -->|No| D[403 Forbidden]
    D --> Z([End])
    C -->|Yes| E[Click Generate Diet Plan]
    E --> F[POST /api/patients/id/diet-plans]
    F --> G[Dispatch GenerateDietPlanJob to queue]
    G --> H[Return 202 — status: pending]
    H --> I[Frontend begins polling]
    I --> J{Job complete?}
    J -->|No — poll again| I
    J -->|Yes| K{Generation succeeded?}
    K -->|No| L[Show error — generation failed]
    L --> Z
    K -->|Yes| M[DietPlan record status → completed\nContent stored as JSON]
    M --> N[Display generated diet plan card]
    N --> Z
